WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.870
Throughout the story and the different adventures
of the straw hat crew, there is a symbol that

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:09.000
appears in seemingly unrelated places over
and over again.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.990
It’s a big sphere with 8 satellites around
it.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.950
This symbol appears on Skypea in the crest
of the shandians, in the flag of Alabasta

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:22.010
and even in Wano, where it’s part of the
Kozuki crest.

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:28.070
Now, what sort of meaning could this symbol
possibly have to connect these 3, honestly

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.300
quite different places?

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:36.720
Could it actually be that, without us realising
it, Oda has already subtly revealed the symbol

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.920
of the ancient kingdom?

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:43.670
The people probably most literate in the history
of the world, next to maybe the Gorosei and

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:47.630
Imu, were the scholars of the island of Ohara.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:52.409
Inside their library, we can see an enormous
Globe, that you’re probably familiar with,

00:00:52.409 --> 00:00:56.560
that seems to show the one piece world surrounded
by multiple spheres.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:01.850
Now similarly to OUR scientific history, it’s
of course entirely possible, that the scholars

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:07.030
of Ohara simply believed the earth to be the
centre of the solar system and these objects

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.149
are the planets circling the earth.

00:01:09.149 --> 00:01:15.069
However, I PERSONALLY think it is not at all
far fetched to assume that they were actually

00:01:15.069 --> 00:01:17.979
WAY more sophisticated than that.

00:01:17.979 --> 00:01:23.650
This would mean that these orbs would in fact
have to be multiple moons, circling the planet.

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:29.369
Now, if that were to be the case, how is it
that we only ever see 1 single moon in the

00:01:29.369 --> 00:01:34.070
sky at night throughout the entire story;
the one moon that we know from Enel’s cover

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:37.279
story, that he calls Vearth?

00:01:37.279 --> 00:01:42.790
Now we know for a fact, that this moon did
indeed harbour life at some point in the past,

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:47.151
and that the Birkas, the winged people of
Skypea, originally came from there, as they

00:01:47.151 --> 00:01:49.690
fled to earth for a lack of resources.

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:54.090
So, what about these other moons from the
astronomical model on Ohara?

00:01:54.090 --> 00:02:00.960
Well, what if in the past, instead of 1, there
were actually 8 moons, each with its own intelligent

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.990
life form, culture and technology?

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:09.130
Due to some unknown event, these moons were
abandoned and/or destroyed at some point in

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:14.210
the past, and its different people fled to
earth to start a new life there.

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.020
Where do I get the number 8 from?

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:18.150
We’ll get to that in a second.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:23.000
Now, as it so happens, we actually do know
a variety of humanoid races inhabiting the

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:27.600
one piece world, that all have their own culture,
history and traditions.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:33.300
The Giants, the Fishmen, the Tontatta, the
long limb tribes, the minks, the Sky people,

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:38.770
humans as well as a number of other potential
races, such as the three eyed tribe and possibly

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:41.540
even a demon or devil race.

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:45.580
Each of these groups could have originally
inhabited their very own world on each of

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.860
the moons.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:50.250
And this concept is actually nothing new.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:54.780
If you watched my video on Shanks, you will
know that Oda draws a lot of inspiration from

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:56.440
nordic mythology.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:01.910
And one of the most important elements of
nordic mythology is yggdrasil, the world tree

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:05.470
that harbours a total of nine connected worlds.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:10.740
The world in the centre is Midgard, the realm
of men, and around it eight worlds inhabited

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.750
by other races.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:17.140
These races also include dwarfs and giants,
that as a matter of fact, we already know

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.410
to live in the One Piece world.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:24.380
And especially the giants as well as their
island Elbaf have CLEARLY been inspired by

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:26.440
nordic mythology.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:31.960
This also includes a gigantuous tree, that
is being hinted at in this scene here.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:35.410
Could this be a reference to Yggdrasil and
the 9 worlds?

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:41.600
I think it’s quite likely, and notably,
one of these worlds also harbours a race of

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:42.670
demons.

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:47.550
Now, being forced to leave their own worlds
behind, each of these races will have come

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:51.950
down to earth, the world of humans and the
last inhabitable place left.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:57.270
Here, the different people lived in constant
conflict and war with each other born from

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:04.930
never-ending power struggles and deep-rooted
prejudice.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:10.770
One day, a charismatic and powerful leader
enters the stage and starts gathering members

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:13.970
of all the different races under his flag.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:18.900
This diverse and unprecedented group starts
to grow in influence and popularity due to

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:22.390
its shared wisdom, friendship and equality.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:27.960
At some point, it grows so large and influential
that it establishes a kingdom that grows into

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:30.650
a place of peace and prosperity.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:35.260
And the leader of this kingdom is a man known
by the name of Joyboy.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:40.300
Joy Boy’s ultimate goal is to unite all
the different races and bring the endless

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:45.430
violence and waring amongst them to a close,
end segregation and racism and create a united

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:50.640
world of freedom and justice, so arguably
what the story of One Piece will in the end

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.490
be all about.

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:57.240
We do know that Joy Boy was starting to fulfil
this plan as he promised the fishmen to bring

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:01.220
them up to the surface and give them equal
rights.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:05.240
However with the growing influence of the
ancient kingdom and its ideals of equality

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:09.800
and freedman, the kingdoms of the humans started
to feel threatened and planned to overthrow

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:15.680
Joy Boy. 20 of them banded together to declare
war on the ancient kingdom, but initially

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:20.290
failed due to its immense shared wisdom, power
and technology.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:25.020
However, when the war threatened to be lost,
they were unexpectedly offered help by the

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:29.970
king of the demon clan, which was despised
and feared by all the other races.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:34.090
He offered the kings to share the powers of
his people with them, in order to turn the

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:39.460
tides against the ancient kingdom and make
them the gods and new rulers of the entire

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:40.460
world.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:46.030
All of this however under one condition, that
he would become the one true king, ruling

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.810
form the shadows.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:54.170
Blinded by power, 19 of the 20 kings took
the deal and so the demon king bestowed upon

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:57.330
them the power of the devil fruits.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:02.590
One of them however, the king of Alabasta,
was wary of the devil and his power and secretly

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:06.230
decided to inform Joy boy about the coming
threat.

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:10.851
Upon hearing about the new powers of their
enemies and their inevitable defeat, joy boy

00:06:10.851 --> 00:06:15.520
decided to do everything in his power to ensure
that his vision would be made reality some

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.560
day.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:21.750
The Kozuki clan, that were part of his kingdom,
created the poneglyphs with instructions and

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:24.880
information about the true history of the
world.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:30.760
Meanwhile, using its advanced technology,
the ancient kingdom created 3 powerful weapons

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:33.370
to oppose the power of the devil fruits.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:38.560
The powers of Poseidon to command powerful
sea monsters, inherited by the fishmen.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:43.940
The power of Pluton, a mighty battle shit,
capable of destroying entire islands, as well

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:49.300
as Uranos, a weapon of unknown power that
might have enabled space travel.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:54.330
And finally, some secret was hidden on an
island, that would later become known as Laugh

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.840
Tale.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:59.720
As Joy Boy had feared, the tides of the war
quickly changed with the sudden appearance

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:01.870
of the devil fruit powers.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:07.470
With their help, the kings artificially changed
the geography of the entire world to ensure

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:11.120
their rule and position of power for centuries
to come.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:16.220
And so the ancient kingdom fell, and the world
had to wait for the return of a new Joy Boy

